<title>USA: Hain Food Group Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Hain Food Group Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>THE HAIN FOOD GROUP, INC.</p>
<p>			   Condensed Statements of Operations</p>
<p>							Quarter Ended</p>
<p>							   June 30,</p>
<p>						   1996(a)	    1995</p>
<p> Net sales				 $ 19,739,000  $ 15,430,000</p>
<p> Net income				     503,000	 430,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			    0.06	    0.05</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		  8,958,000     9,105,000</p>
<p>							  Year Ended</p>
<p>							    June 30,</p>
<p>						 1996(a)		1995</p>
<p> Net sales				$68,606,000     $58,076,000</p>
<p> Net income				 2,134,000	 2,365,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			  0.24		0.28</p>
<p> Weighted average shares		8,964,000	 8,597,000</p>
<p>(a) Results for the quarter and year ended June 30, 1996 include the operations of The Estee Company which was acquired on November 3, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
